    "Generate Report": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Générer le rapport"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi! I'm here to help report a bug. Tell me what's not working in your own words — I'll figure out what diagnostic info to attach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour ! Je vais t'aider à signaler un bug. Décris ce qui ne marche pas avec tes mots — je m'occupe d'attacher les bonnes infos de diagnostic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hit a snag thinking that through. Want to retry?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai eu un souci en réfléchissant. On retente ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How can we reproduce it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment on peut reproduire ?"
